## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Guild
## Notes: Your guild in one window, on Social's full screen (or a window of its own while Social is off): the roster, everybody's gear, quests and runs, loot, professions, the raid's plan and the officers' tools. What members share with the guild is kept on this computer only, per guild; each kind behind a switch. The guild key opens it.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Epicguildtabard
## X-License: MIT

# The module's own table, its words and settings, how it starts and stands down. First: the other files add to it.
Guild.lua
# Every size and spacing, and what follows from the room the window has. Knows no frames
Layout.lua
# The module's pictures: placeholders of the game's art until its own are drawn
Art.lua
# The parts its views are built from: insets, headings, small tabs, tables, the guild's crest, class icons
Kit.lua
# The page: the head with the crest, the tabs, the view's title and small tabs, the status line; the views behind them
Page.lua
# The views
Views\Overview.lua
Views\Roster.lua
Views\Equipment.lua
Views\Later.lua
# Where the page stands: a window of Social's full screen, or a window of its own
Window.lua
# The guild key opens ours (the game's override bindings; our key: Bindings.xml)
Keys.lua
